    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Unknown_Regions\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions\">Star Wars Saga Edition Unknown Regions</a></i> </p><p>A large and cumbersome variation of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vibro-Axe\" title=\"Vibro-Axe\">Vibro-Axe</a>, a Vibro-Saw is typically used to cut down large vegetation such as trees and exceptionally thick vine clusters. However, its impressive cutting power has led the Vibro-Saw to be used to cut through bulkheads in boarding actions by military units and pirates alike. The Vibro-Saw also has the distinct advantage of being legal in areas where the possession of any other type of Vibro weapon is a criminal offense. </p><p>A Vibro-Saw ignores a target's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Damage_Reduction\" title=\"Damage Reduction\">Damage Reduction</a>. A Vibro-Saw requires two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Energy_Cells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Energy Cells\">Energy Cells</a> to operate. </p>",
